# Design system (UI only)

When changing UI, read [`docs/design-system.md`](../../docs/design-system.md) and [`frontend/design/tokens.ts`](../../frontend/design/tokens.ts).

- **Identity** tokens are stable; **signal** tokens reflect facts.
- Meaning before hex. Max **two active signal** tokens per screen.
- Do not add colours without a semantic token. No weather-as-theme.
